<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>概要设计：前后端分离 + MySQL，单机三进程</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD0EA' }}>02 · 概要设计</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 96, width: 600, height: 400, border: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Image src="assets/arch.png" style={{ width: 598, height: 398, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 502, width: 600, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>图：总体架构与部署（浏览器 · Vite · Spring Boot · MySQL 与端口）</Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 700, top: 96, width: 520, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>A2　前后端分离</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>Vue 3.4 + TS 5.4 + Element Plus 2.7（Vite 5.2）<br />Spring Boot 3.2.5 REST + MyBatis（JDK 17）</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>B1　MySQL 8.0 InnoDB</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>4 张表；CHECK 约束依赖 8.0.16+；单机 5173 / 8080 / 3306</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 520, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>模块划分：每个模块挂得上需求编号</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>后端四层：Controller · Service · Mapper · Entity<br />前端六模块：登录 · 空档查询 · 我的预约 · 房间管理 · 预约处理 · 统计</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>14 条 REST 接口，一套统一响应</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>ApiResponse 统一封装 code / message / data；JWT 鉴权，角色在服务端校验而非前端隐藏</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, padding: 12, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '3px solid #3D7BD9' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>两条硬约束：前端零 JDBC、不直连库；跨域只由后端 CorsConfig 放行。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 566, width: 1160, height: 62, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>架构图里的每个部件、端口与启动命令，和根目录 README 的步骤一一对应，现场可复现。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 660, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智能会议室管理系统 V1.0 · 第 4 组答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>04 / 10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
